cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "RatiometricCaImagingSingleTimepoint"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB program for ratiometric intracellular calcium analysis of single-timepoint
  confocal images using the Fluo-4 / Fura-Red dye pair. Performs automated cell
  segmentation by thresholding and distance-transform watershed, background-corrected
  fluorescence quantification on raw channel data, and per-cell export of the
  Fluo-4/Fura-Red intensity ratio together with morphological descriptors.
